{"task": "WH_8289", "job": "WH_8289|H|1", "arm": "H", "attempt": 1, "role": "основной", "outcome": "годный", "reason": "годный", "final": "годный", "waits": 0, "retries": 0, "streak": 0, "flags": {"api_retry_до_начала": 0, "api_retry_после_начала": 0, "оборванный_ход": false, "message_start": 1}, "started": "2026-10-26T08:59:17+00:00", "finished": "2026-10-26T09:01:49+00:00", "config_sha256": "4852eb051287b737e790bccbd76bdf753a8dfb80399f9bdbf57966609690d086", "binary_sha256": "27122ca7b624f537546fbef35b80c66370d974ff258f3d9b10ac50bb8771f262", "cli_init_version": "2.1.294", "cli_pinned_version": "2.1.294", "model_target": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_usage_keys": ["claude-opus-5-5"], "model_usage_out": {"claude-opus-5-5": 15093}, "init_sha256": "19a6ffcf0781096cd8fadcc901d1f698c81748761870f4f438dc6f07a56b3d9a", "session_id": "254420ca-e82c-41ed-97db-4789a8384562", "effort": "high", "thinking_budget": "31999", "thinking_tokens": 13995, "env_config": {"API_TIMEOUT_MS": "1200000", "CLAUDE_BYTE_STREAM_IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS": "180000", "CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_NONESSENTIAL_TRAFFIC": "1", "CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_RETRIES": "0", "CLAUDE_ENABLE_BYTE_WATCHDOG": "1", "CLAUDE_ENABLE_STREAM_WATCHDOG": "1", "CLAUDE_STREAM_FIRST_BYTE_TIMEOUT_MS": "180000", "CLAUDE_STREAM_IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS": "180000", "DISABLE_AUTOUPDATER": "1", "DISABLE_GROWTHBOOK": "1", "MAX_THINKING_TOKENS": "31999"}, "env_access_names": ["ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL", "CLAUDE_CODE_PROXY_RESOLVES_HOSTS", "CLAUDE_SESSION_INGRESS_TOKEN_FILE", "CURL_CA_BUNDLE", "HTTPS_PROXY", "NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS", "NO_PROXY", "PATH", "REQUESTS_CA_BUNDLE", "SSL_CERT_FILE", "https_proxy", "no_proxy"], "usage": {"inp": 6115, "out": 15093, "cost_usd": 0.33307380000000003}, "answer": {"choice": 3}, "exit": {"returncode": 0, "timed_out": false, "stderr_bytes": 0, "stderr_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "spawn_error": null}, "stream": {"file": "WH_8289_H_1-beb83d79.a001.osn.jsonl.gz", "sha256": "40a92956d4306e31187af09e09f5658fb44da7920fac795e8bfe934972958d68", "bytes": 196935, "lines": 461, "events_no_deltas": [{"type": "system", "subtype": "init", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "tools": ["StructuredOutput"], "mcp_servers": [], "permissionMode": "auto", "claude_code_version": "2.1.294", "output_style": "default", "init_sha256": "19a6ffcf0781096cd8fadcc901d1f698c81748761870f4f438dc6f07a56b3d9a"}, {"type": "system", "subtype": "status", "status": "requesting"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "message_start", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgQaEGpdwKuExkjc6Tmd2", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3844, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3844}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "ttft_ms": 1603, "thinking_display": "updates"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 0, "content_block": {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "", "signature": ""}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "thinking_display": "updates"}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgQaEGpdwKuExkjc6Tmd2", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "", "signature": {"длина": 36664, "sha256": "d83f989b886f22c93465e6334f6e2ed817e0d9d6fdfe0bf3c2e6818a1d1675db"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3844, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3844}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-26T09:01:38.878Z", "request_id": "req_011CgQaEGZmLrgQZ723rKMSX", "thinking_duration_ms": 139272}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 0}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 1, "content_block": {"type": "text", "text": ""}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgQaEGpdwKuExkjc6Tmd2", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I pick **candidate 3**. These are mental estimates, not exact figures: I treated the leftover stock as a random walk and didn't simulate it.\n\n**What every candidate shares.** No order arrives before day 2 for product 0 or before day 3 for product 1. So the shortage on those first days, roughly 12 units of product 0 and about 36 of product 1, hits every plan equally. Money is never short, so no plan gets its orders cut.\n\n**How the plans differ:**\n1. **The plans never adjust.** Average demand is about 1.046 × forecast. Leftovers carry over (shelf life is 6 days), so ordering above average demand makes stock build up day after day:\n   - Holding cost grows with the pile.\n   - Whatever is left at the end of day 29 is wasted money.\n   - The extra stock only pays off when it actually prevents a shortage.\n2. **Ordering every day is cheapest.** Ordering every 2 days saves 364 in daily order fees but adds about 510 in holding, because the second day's goods sit for a night. Ordering every 3 days saves 468 but adds about 980 in holding. Candidates 4, 7 and 0 lose to the daily plans on this alone.\n3. **The daily plans differ only in how much they add on top of the forecast.** Candidate 3 orders exactly the forecast; candidates 2, 1, 5 and 6 order about 1.1–1.3 × the forecast.\n\n**Candidate 3 against candidate 2, by product:**\n\n| | Candidate 3 | Candidate 2 | Effect of 2's extra stock |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Product 0: total ordered | 506 | 556 | costs about 600 more |\n| Product 0: expected lost sales | ~35 | ~12 | saves about 23 × 27 ≈ 630 |\n| Product 0: holding | — | — | costs about 330 more |\n| Product 1: total ordered | 681 | 783 | costs about 510 more |\n| Product 1: expected lost sales | ~47 | ~8 | saves about 700 |\n| Product 1: holding | — | — | costs about 680 more |\n\nExpected demand is about 529 units of product 0 and 712 of product 1 over the days orders can cover. The cost of a lost unit is the missed sale plus the penalty: 27 for product 0, 18 for product 1.\n\nNet, candidate 3 comes out ahead by about 300 on product 0 and about 490 on product 1. Candidates 1, 5 and 6 order even more than candidate 2, so they lose by more.\n\n**Other plans and risk:**\n- **Candidate 7** orders every 2 days at about 1.05 × average demand. It ends up about 580 behind candidate 3.\n- **Candidate 4** orders every 3 days and gets the quantities about right. It still loses about 400 to holding costs. It also risks losing goods to the 140-unit limit, around day 24 when 90 units of product 1 arrive.\n- **Candidate 3 under random demand:** its stock stays low, so it never comes near the space limit or the shelf life. Its main exposure is shortages when demand runs high, and every candidate pays for those."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3844, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3844}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-26T09:01:49.482Z", "request_id": "req_011CgQaE